                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-02-22"><hi rendition="#italic">February 22,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Leishman reports that word has been received from the brigands requesting
                    the committee not to be uneasy at the delay, which is caused by difficulties
                    beyond their immediate control. * * *)</p>
            </div>
